flowchart TD
    Start([Start: DispatchNotificationAsync]) --> Input[/Input: target, event, reference_id/]
    Input --> CheckEmpty{Target/Event empty?}
    
    CheckEmpty -- Yes --> Err1[/Return Error: Invalid parameters/]
    CheckEmpty -- No --> CheckTarget{Is target a Role?}
    
    CheckTarget -- Yes --> QRoleUsers[(Query USERS by Role)]
    QRoleUsers --> AddRoleEmails[Insert into recipient_emails]
    
    CheckTarget -- No --> QUser[(Query USERS by ID)]
    QUser --> AddUserEmail[Insert into recipient_emails]
    
    AddRoleEmails --> Builder[Call TemplateBuilder]
    AddUserEmail --> Builder
    
    Builder --> LoopStart{More recipients?}
    
    LoopStart -- Yes --> Resend[Call ResendAPI_SendEmail]
    Resend --> InitLog[Initialize log_record]
    InitLog --> InsertLog[(Insert into D7: AUDIT_LOGS)]
    InsertLog --> LoopStart
    
    LoopStart -- No --> Output[/Return Success/]
    Output --> End([End])
    
    Err1 --> End